 active: %1$s and %2$s work together'=>'Hadaddiyar haɗin gwiwa tana aiki: %1$s da %2$s suna aiki tare','%s is active on this site, so both plugins share one set of AI provider keys and one settings screen for them.'=>'%s yana aiki a wannan shafin, don haka duk plugins ɗin suna raba saitin maɓallan mai ba da sabis na AI ɗaya da allo na saituna ɗaya don su.','Translate this site with Tranzly'=>'Fassara wannan shafin tare da Tranzly','Build pages visually with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Gina shafuka ta hanyar gani tare da Page Builder Sandwich','%s, from Zinn Digital®'=>'%s, daga Zinn Digital®','Publish every page in many languages, with translated addresses, SEO data and a language switcher. Works with the pages you build here.'=>'Bugaje kowane shafi a cikin harsuna da yawa, tare da adireshin da aka fassara, bayanan SEO da kuma mai sauya harshe. Yana aiki tare da shafukan da kuka gina anan.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Zana shafuka kai tsaye a cikin edita tare da manyan gine-gine masu sauri kuma marasa sawu. Komai da kuka gina yana fassara tare da Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'Ƙungiyar ce ta yi %s kuma tana aiki tare da wannan plugin din.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Ka yard da haɗa wannan shafin da farko.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Shigar da ingantacciyar adireshin imel.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Yi yarda da tura bayanan goyon baya da farko.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Rubuta jigo da sako.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel wanda ƙungiyar tallafi za ta iya ba da amsa.','Temporary support access created by the site owner. It is deleted automatically when it expires.'=>'Wucin-gadi mai ba da tallafi da mai shafin ya kirkira. Za a goge shi ta atomatik idan lokacinsa ya kare.','Choose 1, 3 or 7 days.'=>'Zaɓi kwanaki 1, 3 ko 7.','Only a site administrator, signed in to this screen, can create temporary support access.'=>'Mai gudanar da shafin ne kawai, wanda ya shiga wannan allo, zai iya ƙirƙirar damar tallafi na ɗan lokaci.','A unique user name could not be chosen. Try again.'=>'Ba a iya zaɓar keɓaɓɓen sunan mai amfani ba. Sake gwadawa.','Zinn Digital® support (temporary)'=>'Tallafin Zinn Digital® (na wucin gadi)','This temporary support access has expired.'=>'Wannan damar ta tallafi ta ɗan lokaci ta ƙare.','AI providers'=>'Masu samar da AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Masu ƙirƙirar ChatGPT. Mai amfani a kowane fanni mai kyau.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Masu samar da Claude. Suna da ƙarfi wajen rubuce-rubuce kuma suna da hankali wajen yin la\'akari.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Samfuran Gemini na Google. Masu sauri da rahusa.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Kamfanin AI na Turai tare da sauri, samfura masu rahusa.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Samfura masu rahusa wadanda ke da kyau wajen rubutu da shirya lamba.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Maɓalli guda ɗaya don samfuran daga masu samarwa daban-daban.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Duk wani sabis da ke aiki kamar API na OpenAI, gami da samfurin da ke aiki akan kwamfutarka ko uwar garken ka.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Gabaɗaya (ana amfani da shi lokacin da ba a saita wani abu na musamman ba)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Rubutawa da sake rubutawa','Translation'=>'Fassarar','Code and CSS'=>'Lamba da CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin shiga wannan shafin ba.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Ana raba waɗannan saitunan ta kowane plugin da ke amfani da su: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'An rufe makullan ku a cikin bayanan wannan rukunin yanar gizo kuma ana tura su ne kawai ga mai ba da sabis ɗin da kuka zaɓa - ba za a taɓa tura su zuwa gare mu ba.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Mataki na 1 na 2: zabi mai ba da sabis na AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Kuna kawo naku madogara, don haka kuna biyan mai bayar da sabis ɗin kai tsaye don abin da kuka yi amfani da shi. Ba ku da tabbas? Kowane ɗayan waɗannan yana aiki sosai; za ku iya ƙara ƙarin daga baya.','Next'=>'Na gaba','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Mataki na 2 na 2: haɗa %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗin da ke dace da OpenAI, wanda ya ƙare da /v1. Ana buƙatar maɓalli ne kawai idan sabis ɗin ya nemi ɗaya.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Buɗe %s sannan ka shiga (ko ka ƙirƙiri sabon ajiya kyauta).','the %s API keys page'=>'shafin maɓallan API na %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli sannan ka kofe shi.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Saka shi a ƙasa sannan ka danna "Ajiye ka gwada". Muna tura ƙaramin buƙatu guda ɗaya don tabbatar yana aiki.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Yawancin masu ba da sabis na buƙatar ɗan kuɗi a cikin asusun kafin maɓalli ya yi aiki: %s.','add credit'=>'ƙara kuɗi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Zabi wani mai ba da sabis daban','Address'=>'Adiireshi','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Maɓallin da aka adana ya ƙare da …%s — liƙa sabo don maye gurbinsa','Key (optional)'=>'Maɓalli (zaɓaɓɓe)','API key'=>'Maɓullin API','Save and test'=>'Ajiye kuma a gwada','Providers'=>'Masu bada sabis','Provider'=>'Mai ba da sabis','Status'=>'Matsayi','Key'=>'Mabuɗi','Get a key'=>'Samu maɓalli','Test'=>'Gwaji','Remove'=>'Cire','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'An adana ta ta hanyar sabon sigar plugin: sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma sake shigar da maɓallin.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin da aka ajiye ba kuma (an canza maɓallin tsaron shafin). Sake shigar da shi.','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa shi ba','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'An haɗa - gwajin ƙarshe ya yi nasara %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Gwajin karshe ya gaza: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'An haɗa — ba a gwada ba tukuna','Which model to use'=>'Wane samfurin da za a yi amfani da shi','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ ta nuna shawararmu don wannan aikin. Jerin ya ƙunshi kowane samfurin da maɓallinku zai iya amfani da shi, wanda aka karanta kai tsaye daga mai bada sabis.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— An ba da shawarar ga mai bada sabis —','Save models'=>'Ajiye samfura','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sake sabunta jerin samfuran daga masu samarwa','Images'=>'Hotuna','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Haɗa OpenAI ko Google Gemini don yin hotuna.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin hoto na farko na mai ba da sabis da aka haɗa —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Binciken shafin (embeddings)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Haɗa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter don gina fihirisar bincike na shafin ku.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin sakawa na farko mai alaƙa da mai ba da sabis —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Canja wannan yana sake gina fihirisa ta bincike na kowane toshe da ke amfani da ita.','best quality'=>'mafi kyau','lowest cost'=>'mafi ƙarancin farashi','fastest'=>'mafi sauri','Add a model yourself'=>'Kara abin koyi da kanka','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'An fitar da sabon samfuri a yau? A mannainiini sunansa daidai domin amfani da shi nan take.','Model name'=>'Sunan samfurin','Add model'=>'Ƙara samfurin','Recommended models list'=>'Jerin abubuwan da aka ba da shawarar','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Ba a iya tabbatar da jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar ba, don haka ba a nuna shawarwari ba. Sake shigar da plugin ɗin, ko kuma kunna sabuntawa na yau da kullum a ƙasa.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Jerin da ake amfani da shi an wallafa shi a ranar %s. Kowane sabuntawar fasalin ƙari yana kawo sabon abu.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Haka zalika, bincika Zinn Digital® sau ɗaya a rana don samun sabon jerin abubuwa.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ana aika da sauƙaƙe buƙatar zazzagewa kawai: babu makulli, babu adireshin shafi, babu komai game da abun cikin ku. Jerin yana da sa hannu, kuma ana watsi da jerin da ya kasa gwajin sa hannu.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'An duba ta ƙarshe %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Ajiye, sannan a bincika yanzu idan an kunna','a newer list was installed'=>'an shigar da sabon jerin sunaye','already up to date'=>'an riga an sabunta','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'an saukar da shi ya gaza binciken sa hannu kuma an yi watsi da shi','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Ba za a iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba; jerin na yanzu zai ci gaba da amfani','turned off'=>'an kashe','Open'=>'Buɗe','Check their status page'=>'Bincika shafin yanayin su','Open your billing page'=>'Buɗe shafin ku na biyan kuɗi','Open your API keys page'=>'Buɗe shafin maɓallan API naka','Open the AI settings'=>'Buɗe saitunan AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin yin hakan ba.','Unknown provider.'=>'Ba a san mai ba da sabis din ba.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Shigar da adireshin aikinku, alal misali http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Wannan bai yi kama da maɓallin API ba. Sake kwafi shi, ba tare da guraben sarari ba.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Da farko a liƙa maɓallin API ɗinka.','Key removed.'=>'An cire maɓallin.','Models saved.'=>'An adana samfuran.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Shigar dainiyan sunan samfurin, alal misali kamar yadda takardun bayanin mai ba da sabis suka rubuta shi.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'An kara %s. Zabi shi a karkashin "Wane samfurin za a yi amfani da shi".','Model removed.'=>'An cire samfurin.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'An kashe sabuntawa kullum. Ana amfani da jerin da ya zo tare da plugin din.','Checked: %s.'=>'An bincika: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'An sabunta jerin samfuran.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Wani sabon sigar na ɗaya daga cikin plugins ɗinka ya adana maɓallin AI ɗinka. Sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma ka sake shigar da maɓallin a cikin saitunan AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin AI da ka adana ba (an sauya maɓallin tsaro na shafin). Sake shigar da shi a cikin saitunan AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a saita AI ba tukuna. Ƙara maɓalli don mai ba da AI a cikin saitunan AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a zaɓi wani samfuri ba don wannan aikin. Zaɓi ɗaya a cikin saitunan AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba a goyi bayansa da wannan sigar ta plugin ba.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Babu mai samar da AI da zai iya ƙirƙirar hotuna da aka haɗa. Ƙara maɓallin OpenAI ko Google Gemini a cikin saitunan AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba zai iya yin hotuna ba. Zaɓi OpenAI ko Google Gemini don hotuna a cikin saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Ba za a iya amfani da mabudin AI naka tare da wani samfurin hoto ba. Duba izinin mabudin tare da mai ba da sabis din, ko zaɓi wani mai ba da sabis din don hotuna.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Babuu wani mai ba da sabis na AI da aka haɗa wanda zai iya gina fihirisar bincike. Ƙara maɓallin Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter a cikin saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Ba za a iya amfani da mabudin AI naka tare da wani samfurin embedding ba. Bincika izinin mabudin tare da mai ba da sabis din, ko zaɓi wani mai ba da sabis din daban don binciken shafin.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba zai iya gina fihirisar bincike ba. Haɗa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko sabis ɗin da ya dace don binciken shafin.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya isa ga sabis na AI naka ba. Tabbatar cewa yana aiki kuma ana iya isa ga adireshinsa daga sabar yanar gizonka (ba za a iya isa ga sabis da ke kan kwamfutarka ba daga wani shafin da aka karbi bakuncinsa).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Ba a iya samun %s a wannan shafin ba. Duba shafin su na halin yaki; idan yana aiki, mai masaukin bakin ka na iya toshe haɗin waje, ko kuma adreshin ba daidai ba ne.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s ya ce asusunka ba shi da kuɗi ko kuma adadin da ya rage. Ƙara kuɗi ko ɗaga iyakar a cikin asusunka tare da su, sannan a sake gwadawa.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s bai karɓi maɓallin ku ba. Yana iya zama an rubuta shi ba daidai ba, an soke shi, ko ya ƙare. Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli kuma liƙa shi a nan.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s ya ki amincewa da wannan roƙo na madannin ku. Madannin wataƙila ba shi da damar shiga wannan samfurin ko fasalin, ko kuma asusun ku na buƙatar tabbatarwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a samun samfurin "%1$s" daga %2$s don makullin ku. Zaɓi wani samfurin daban a cikin saitunan AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Tsarin ku na %2$s bai haɗa da samfurin "%1$s" ba. Zaɓi wani samfurin a cikin saitunan AI, ko haɓaka tsarin ku tare da su.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s na takaita saurin da maɓallin ku zai iya aika buƙatu. Jira minti guda sannan a ƙara gwadawa, ko kuma a ƙara iyakar ƙimar ku tare da su.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s yana fuskantar matsaloli a yanzu (akwai matsalar katsewar sabis ko cunkoso a ɓangarensu). Babu wata matsala game da saitunanka. Sake gwadawa nan ba da dadewa ba.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Aikace-aikacen AI ya gaza saboda dalilin da ba za mu iya gane shi ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ya ci gaba da faruwa, tuntuɓi sashen goyon baya tare da bayanan da ke ƙasa.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na AI ya ba da amsa a wata sifa da wannan plugin ɗin bai iya karantawa ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ya ci gaba da faruwa, zaɓi wani samfurin ko tuntuɓi goyon baya.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Na Musamman (mai jituwa da OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Ajiye maɓalli don wannan mai bada sabis ɗin da farko.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Makullin ku yana aiki, amma mai ba da sabis ɗin bai lissafa wani samfurin rubutu ba a kansa. Ƙara samfurin da kanku a ƙasa.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'An haɗa. %1$s ya/ta amsa ta amfani da %2$s. Siffofin AI ɗinka suna shirye don amfani.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Ba a ba matsayin mai amfani da ku damar amfani da AI a wannan shafin ba. Tambayi mai gudanarwa.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar kasafin kuɗinsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara shi a cikin saitunan AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar buƙatunsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara ta a cikin saitunan AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Amfani da tsada','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Littafin shiga, iyakoki da izinin matsayi suna aiki ga AI da ake amfani da ita ta hanyar: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kudin suna da kusan zatowa, an lissafa su daga farashin da aka buga; samfurin da babu wani sanannen farashin shi yana ƙidaya azaman sifili.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Wannan watan: buƙatun %1$s, kusan %2$s.','When'=>'Lokaci','Who'=>'Wane','Used for'=>'Yi amfani da shi don','Model'=>'Samfurin','Tokens in / out'=>'Wajen Tokens / Waje','About'=>'Game da','Result'=>'Sakamako','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Ba a yi buƙatun AI ba tukuna.','Done'=>'An gama','Limits and permissions'=>'Iyaka da izini','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Iyakar kashe kuɗi ta kowane wata (dalar US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Bar shi ba komai don babu iyaka. AI zai tsaya na sauran watan da zarar kusan farashin ya kai hakan.','Monthly request limit'=>'Iyakokin buƙatu na kowane wata','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Bar shi da babu komai don babu iyaka.','Who may use AI'=>'Wane ne zai iya amfani da AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Cire daukacin zabubbuka domin ba wa kowa damar amfani da AI wanda zai iya amfani da sassan plugin din. Masu gudanarwa za su iya amfani da shi kowane lokaci.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Ajiye iyakoki da izini','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'An adoke da izini an adana.','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Wannan harshe ba ya cikin harsunan da wannan shafin ke amfani da su.','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'Dole fassarar ta zama iri ɗaya da ta asali.','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'Zaɓi wani daga cikin sauran harsunan shafin yanar gizon.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Rubutun allo na admin ba ya nan a cikin wannan kwafin na plugin ɗin. Sake shigar da shi daga fakitin da aka fitar.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Wannan allon yana buƙatar JavaScript.','Choose a language'=>'Zaɓi harshe','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Dole ne prefix ya zama haruffa kanana 1 zuwa 8 ko lambobi, ya fara da harafi, kuma kada ya sanya wa plugin ɗin suna.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" ba lambar yare ba ne. Yi amfani da wani locale na WordPress kamar fr_FR ko de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Lisƙa aƙalla harshe ɗaya.','Translations'=>'Fassarori','Edit the %s version'=>'Gyara sigar %s','Compare the %s version side by side'=>'Kwatanta sigar %s a gefe da gefe','Choose one of your menus for each language.'=>'Zaɓi ɗaya daga cikin menu ɗinka ga kowane harshe.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to protect.'=>'Wannan ba fassarar ba ce, don haka babu wani abu da za a kare.','This kind of content is not translated.'=>'Ba a fassara irin wannan abun ciki ba.','Text %s is not on this site any more. Reload the page.'=>'Rubutu %s babu shi a kan wannan shafin kuma. Sake lodi shafin.','No translation engine could take this text.'=>'Babu injin fassara da zai iya ɗaukar wannan rubutu.','Choose one of your other languages.'=>'Zaɓi ɗaya daga cikin sauran harsunanka.','Compare translation'=>'Kwatanta fassara','You are not allowed to edit this translation.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin gyara wannan fassara ba.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to compare.'=>'Wannan ba fassara ba ce, don haka babu abin da za a kwatanta.','The original of this translation no longer exists.'=>'Asalin wannan fassarar babu shi kuma.','Piece %s is not part of this translation any more. Reload the page and try again.'=>'Yanki %s ba ya cikin wannan fassarar kuma. Sake lodi shafin sannan a sake gwadawa.','Translate on this page'=>'Fassara a wannan shafin','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'Ba a baka izinin fassara wannan abu ba.','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'Wannan abu yana da fasali a cikin wannan harshe tuni.','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'Ba a samun wannan injin fassara a wannan shafin ba.','Different engines per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Injini daban-daban ga kowane harshe, madadin atomatik, da iyakokin kashe kudi sune fasalolin Tranzly Pro.','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'Dole kowane harshen ya zama daya daga cikin harsunan shafin, tare da injin da ke akwai.','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'Jerin madadin na iya sanya suna ne kawai ga injinan da ake da su.','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'Wani iyaka na wata-wata adadi ne a cikin US dollars, sifili ko fiye da haka, don injin da yake a sama.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'Abubuwan da aka fi so na fassara da kuma sautin magana a kowane harshe fasali ne na Tranzly Pro. Jerin abubuwan da kada a fassara kyauta ne.','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'Dole ne a raba shigarwar ƙamus bisa ga ɗaya daga cikin harsunan shafin.','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'Ana saita sautin ne ga kowane harshen shafin: tsarin ladabi na asali, sama ko kasa, tare da karin umarni na zabi.','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'Darajar %s ba ta cikin abubuwan da aka yarda da su ba.','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'Babu layin baya a wannan shafin.','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'Ana gudanar da aikin fassara a matsayin mutumin da ya kaddamar da shi, don haka dole ne mai amfani ya shiga tsarin.','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'Babu abin da aka ba ka izinin fassara a cikin wannan zabi.','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'Wannan abu ba wani bangare bane na aikin fassara.','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin canza wannan fassarar ba.','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'Rungiyar wannan abu tana da nau\'in %1$s riga (#%2$d).','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'Ba zai yiwu abu ya zama fassarar kansa ba.','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'Wannan abu fassara ce ta wani abu daban. A cire haɗin farko.','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana hanyar fassara ba.','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'Ba za a iya fassara wannan rubutu a nan ba.','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'Ba za a iya fassara rubutun kafofin watsa labarai a nan ba.','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'Ana iya buga fassarar ko a adana ta a matsayin daftari.','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'Ba a ba ka izinin buga irin wannan abun ciki ba.','This item is already written in that language.'=>'Wannan abu an riga an rubuta shi a wannan harshen.','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'Wannan fassarar mutum ne ya gyara ta (ko kuma aka shigo da ita), don haka tana da kariya. Buɗe ta don sake fassara ta.','That item does not exist.'=>'Wancan abu bai wanzu ba.','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'Ba a saita injin fassara ba tukuna. Ƙara maɓalli don ɗaya a cikin Tranzly → Engines.','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'Ba a saita injin fassarar nan ba tukuna: da farko a ƙara maɓallinsa.','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'Ana fassara rubutun iri ɗaya ta wani aiki yanzu haka; wannan abun zai yi amfani da waccan amsar.','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'Babu wani injinin fassarar da zai iya ɗaukar wannan abu.','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'Injiniya bai dawo da fassarar kowane bangare na wannan abu ba. Ba a canza komai ba.','AI model'=>'Samfurin AI','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'Samfurin AI (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s na fuskantar matsaloli a halin yanzu. Sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba, ko kuma ka yi amfani da wani injin daban.','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Shafinka bai iya isa ga %s ba. Tabbatar cewa yana iya yin haɗin waje, sannan a sake gwadawa.','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s bai karɓi maɓallin API ɗinka ba. Duba maɓallin da ke cikin Tranzly → Engines.','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'Asusunka na %s ya ƙare ko kuma ya ƙare ma\'aunin kuɗinsa. Cika shi da su, ko kuma ka yi amfani da wata injin ɗin.','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s ya buƙaci mu rage gudu. Za a sake gwadawa ta atomatik.','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'Wannan rubutu yana da tsayi sosai ga %s a lokaci guda. Raba abubuwan da ke ciki, ko kuma yi amfani da wani inji daban.','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s ya ki fassar wannan abun ciki. Gwada wata injin ɗin, ko ka fassara shi da hannu.','%s does not translate this language. Choose another engine for it.'=>'%s baya fassara wannan harshe. Zaɓi wani injin daban don shi.','This month\'s spending cap for %s is reached, so nothing more was sent to it. Raise the cap in Tranzly → Engines, or wait until next month.'=>'An kai ga iyakar kashe kudi na wannan wata na %s, don haka babu wani abu da aka kara turawa zuwa gare shi. Ƙara iyakar a Tranzly → Engines, ko kuma jira har zuwa wata mai zuwa.','The translation with %s failed for a reason Tranzly could not identify. The details are below.'=>'Fassarar tare da %s ta gaza saboda dalilin da Tranzly bai iya ganewa ba. Ga cikakken bayanin a kasa.','An engine id must be lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Dole idin injini ya zama ƙananan baƙaƙe, lamba, da kuma alamar raba kalma (hyphens).','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'maɓallin lasisi','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Har yanzu ba a haɗa mai amfani da lasisin ba, wanda hakan ke da mahimmanci don hana kunnawa ba tare da izini ba. Don sanya lasisin ga mai amfani da ku, kun yarda ku raba cikakken suna da adireshin imel na mai amfani na WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'shafukan da aka ambata a sama','Account'=>'Asusun ajiyar','Account Details'=>'Bayanin Asusun','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Asusun yana jiran kunnawa. Da fatan za a duba imel ɗinku sannan ku danna mahaɗin don kunna asusun ku sannan ku sake ƙaddamar da fom ɗin abokin tarayya.',