 mintoci kaɗan.','Add-On'=>'Ƙari','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s ƙarin abu ne na musamman na biya kawai. Dole ne ka fara siyan lasisi kafin ka kunna plugin ɗin.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'An nasarar sayen %s Add-on.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'An ciyar da tsarin Add-on ɗin ka na %s zuwa babban mataki cikin nasara.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'An cire %s kyauta cikin nasara. Tunda ƙarin yana da alaƙa ne kawai da tsarin biyan kuɗi, an kashe shi ta atomatik. Idan kana son amfani da shi a nan gaba, dole ne ka sayi lasisi.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'Ba za a iya gudanar da %s ba ba tare da fasalin ba.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ba zai iya aiki ba ba tare da %2$s ba.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Kawai ina sanar da ku cewa ana dauko bayanan kari na %s daga wani sabar na waje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Ƙarin kayan aiki na na\'urar %s','Address Line %d'=>'Layin Adireshin %d','Affiliate'=>'Abokin haɗin gwiwa','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Saboda keta sharuddan haɗin gwiwarmu, mun yanke shawarar dakatar da asusun haɗin gwiwarku na wani dan lokaci. Idan kuna da wata tambaya, da fatan za a tuntuɓi sashen goyon baya.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'An dakatar da asusun abokin tarayyarka na wani ɗan lokaci.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'An karɓi buƙatar ku ta zama abokin ciniki na %1$s! Shiga yankinku na abokan ciniki a: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Na gode da neman shiga cikin shirinmu na abokan hulɗa, abin takaici, mun yanke shawarar kin amince da roƙon ku a yanzu. Don Allah a sake gwadawa bayan kwanaki 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Na gode da neman shiga cikin shirinmu na abokan hulɗa, za mu duba bayanan ku a cikin kwanaki 14 masu zuwa kuma za mu tuntube ku da karin bayani.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s biyan gurbin sa ido bayan ziyarar farko don haɓaka damar samun kuɗi.','Affiliation'=>'Alaka','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Da zarar lasisin ku ya ƙare, har yanzu za ku iya amfani da sigar Kyauta amma BA za ku sami damar amfani da fasalulluka na %s ba.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Da zaran lasisin ku ya ƙare, ba za ku ƙara iya amfani da %s ba, sai dai idan kun sake kunna shi da ingantaccen lasisin ƙima.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Har yanzu kuna iya jin daɗ તમામ abubuwan da ke cikin %1$s amma ba za ku sami damar samun sabuntawar tsaro da fasali na %2$s ba, Haka ma tallafi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Na gode da ingantawa.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bayan kyautarka ta %1$s, biya kaɗan kamar %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Yardika & Kunna Lasisi','I Agree - Change User'=>'Na Yarda - Canza Mai Amfani','All Requests'=>'Dukkan Bukatun','All Types'=>'Duk Nau\'uka','allow'=>'ba da izini','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Ka riga ka yarda da shiga cikin t