ot have a premium code version.'=>'Plugin "Serviceware" ne wanda hakan ke nufin ba shi da sigar lambar kuɗi ta musamman.','Automatic Installation'=>'Shigarwa ta Kanta','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Kashewa ta atomatik a cikin:','Average Rating'=>'Matsakaicin Matsayi','Awesome'=>'Mai kyau','based on %s'=>'dangane da %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Zama abokin hulɗa','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Kuna son %s? Ku zama jakadanmu kuma ku sami kuɗi ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Sannu, ka san cewa %1$s yana da shirin haɗin gwiwa? Idan kuna son %2$s za ku iya zama jakadan mu kuma ku sami ɗan kuɗi!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Mafi kyau','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Sabuntawa zuwa sigar Beta zata maye gurbin sigar da ka shigar na %s da sabon sigar Beta - yi amfani da shi cikin kintatawa, kuma kada a yi amfani da shi a shafukan samarwa. An gargabe ka.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'An biya %s','Billing'=>'Biyan Kuɗi','Billing & Invoices'=>'Biyan Kuɗi & Lissafin Kuɗi','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'An toshe','Blocking'=>'Ana kullewa','Blog ID'=>'Lambar Blog','Body'=>'Jiki','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Eh - adireshin biyun nawa ne','Bundle'=>'Haɗe','Bundle Plan'=>'Tsarin Kunshin','Business name'=>'Sunan kamfani','Buy license'=>'Sayen lasisi','Buy a license now'=>'Sayi lasisi yanzu','Cancel'=>'Soke','Cancel Installation'=>'Soke Shigarwa','Cancel Subscription'=>'Soke Biyan Kuɗi','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Idan ba ka/ki da shirin amfani da wannan %1$s a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon (ko wani rukunin yanar gizon ma) - kana/kina son soke %2$s din ma?','Cancel Trial'=>'Soke Gwaji','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Soke gwajin zai hana shiga cikin duk wasu abubuwa masu inganci nan take. Kana da tabbas?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Soke %s & Ci gaba','Cancelled'=>'An soke','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Ana soke rajistar','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ba za ka iya samun mabudin lasisin ka ba?','Change License'=>'Canza lasisi','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'An tura sakon imel na tabbatarwa zuwa %s. Dole ne ka tabbatar da sabuntawa a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa. Idan ba za ka iya samun imel din ba, da fatan za a duba babban fayil din spam naka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'An tura imel na tabbatarwa zuwa %s. Dole ne mai imel ya tabbatar da sabuntawa a cikin sa\'o\'i 4 masu zuwa.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s shine sabon mai mallakar asusun.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Na gode da tabbatar da canjin mallaka. An aika da imel zuwa %s don amincewa ta ƙarshe.','Change Ownership'=>'Canza Mallaka','Change Plan'=>'Canja Tsarin Aiki','Change User'=>'Canja Mai Amfani','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Ta hanyar sauya mai amfani, kun yarda ku canja wurin mallakar asusun ga:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Canjin tarihin abubuwa','Changing user, please wait'=>'Ana canza mai amfani, don Allah a jira','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Idan ba ka karɓi imel ɗin ba, ka gwada duba babban fayil ɗin da ba a buƙata ba ko kuma ka bincika imel daga %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Biya kuɗi','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Zaɓi har shafin / shafukan yanar gizo %s domin kunna lasisin.','City'=>'Birni','Clear API Cache'=>'Share Ka\'idar API Cache','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Share Wankakken Sabuntawa','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Danna nan','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Danna nan don amfani da plugin din ba tare da nuna suna ba','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Danna domin ganin sharhi da suka bayar da ƙimar %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'Adireshin imel na abokin cinikina shine %s','Code'=>'Lambar asiri','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Kaso %s lokacin da abokin ciniki ya siya sabon lasisi.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Kamar yadda muke keɓe kwanaki 30 don yiwuwar mayar da kuɗi, muna biyan kwamitocin da suka wuce kwanaki 30 kawai.','Communication'=>'Sadarwa','Compatible up to'=>'Mai jituwa har zuwa','complete the opt-in'=>'kammala rajista','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Murna','Never miss an important update'=>'Karɓe kowane sabuntawa mai mahimmanci','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Na gode da sabuntawa zuwa %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Yi rijista domin karɓar sanarwar imel don sabunta tsaro da fasali, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci, da kuma raba wasu basic WordPress yanayin muhalli. Wannan zai taimake mu mu sanya %s ya fi dacewa da shafin ku kuma mafi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙatar ya yi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Yi rajista don samun sanarwar imel don sabunta tsaro & siffofi, abubuwan ilimi, da lokaci-lokaci na musamman, da kuma raba wasu mahimman bayanan muhalli na WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Idan ka tsallake wannan, ba komai! %1$s zai ci gaba da aiki da kyau sosai.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Mun gabatar da wannan zaɓi don kar ku taɓa rasa muhimmin sabuntawa kuma ku taimaka mana mu sa %s ya fi dacewa da shafin ku kuma ya fi kyau wajen yin abin da kuke buƙata ya yi.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Muna matukar farin ciki da gabatar da haɗin gwiwar matakin cibiyar sadarwa na Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'A lokacin aikin sabuntawa mun gano shafin ko shafuka %s a cikin hanyar sadarwa waɗanda har yanzu ke buƙatar kulawar ku.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'A yayin aikin sabuntawa mun gano shafin/shafukan yanar gizo %d da har yanzu suke jiran kunna lasisi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Idan kana son amfani da %s a waɗannan shafuka, don Allah shigar da madogaran lasisin ka a ƙasa sannan ka danna maɓallin kunna shi.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'A madadin haka, zaka iya tsallake shi a yanzu ka kunna lasisin daga baya a shafin Account na matakin hanyar sadarwa na %s dinka.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Haɗe','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Da zarar kun gama, kashe %s sannan ku sake kunna shi.','Contact'=>'Tuntuɓe mu','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Don Allah sanar da mu idan kana son mu tuntube ka game da sabunta tsaro da fasali, abubuwan il