ersion, SDK version'=>'URL na shafi na farko, %s version, SDK version','To let you manage & control where the license is activated and ensure %s security & feature updates are only delivered to websites you authorize.'=>'Domin ba da damar ka sarrafa & daidaita inda aka kunna lasisin kuma a tabbatar an aika sabuntawar tsaro & fasali na %s kawai zuwa shafukan yanar gizo da ka ba da izini.','Current %s & SDK versions, and if active or uninstalled'=>'Na yanzu %s & nau\'ikan SDK, kuma idan suna aiki ko ba a shigar da su ba','Is active, deactivated, or uninstalled'=>'Yana aiki, an kashe shi, ko an cire shi','View Plugins & Themes List'=>'Duba Lissafin Fਲugins & Jigo-jigo','Newsletter'=>'Wasiƙar labarai','Updates, announcements, marketing, no spam'=>'Sabuntawa, sanarwa, tallace-tallace, babu spam','View Basic Profile Info'=>'Duba Cikakken Bayanin Asali','Your WordPress user\'s: first & last name, and email address'=>'Sunan mai amfani na WordPress: sunan farko & na ƙarshe, da adireshin imel','Never miss important updates, get security warnings before they become public knowledge, and receive notifications about special offers and awesome new features.'=>'Karka taba rasa muhimman sabuntawa, sami gargaɗin tsaro kafin su zama sanannun jama\'a, kuma ka karɓi sanarwa game da tayi na musamman da sabbin abubuwa masu ban sha\'awa.','View Basic Website Info'=>'Dubi Cikakkun Bayanan Yanar Gizo na Asali','Homepage URL & title, WP & PHP versions, and site language'=>'URL da taken shafin gida, nau\'ikan WP da PHP, da harshen shafin','To provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break your website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Domin bayar da kararin aiki wanda ya dace da yanar gizon ku, a guji rashin jituwa da sigar WordPress ko PHP wanda zai iya lalata yanar gizon ku, kuma a gane wace harsuna da yankuna ya kamata a fassara %s kuma a daidaita su.',