Manage your licence and billing'=>'Gudanar da lasisin ku da biyan kuɗi','Get more with Pro'=>'Samun kari tare da Pro','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Fara gwaji kyauta na kwanaki %d, babu buƙatar katin biyan kuɗi' . "\0" . 'Fara gwaji kyauta na kwanaki %d, babu buƙatar katin biyan kuɗi','See plans and prices'=>'Duba tsari da farashin kaya','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Yi amfani da Tranzly da Page Builder Sandwich tare? Kunshin ya haɗa da duka plugins ɗin Pro akan farashi mai rahusa.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Lasisin ku ya ƙare. Sabunta shi don ci gaba da samun sabuntawa da fasalulluka na Pro.','Renew now'=>'Sabunta yanzu','Compare the plans'=>'Kwatanta tsare-tsaren','Search features'=>'Bincike features','Area'=>'Yanki','Included in'=>'An haɗa a cikin','No feature matches.'=>'Babu fasalin da ya dace.','Features by plan'=>'Siffofi bisa ga tsari','Hide'=>'Boye','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Kunna shi a kan allon Plugins','Install it'=>'Shigar da shi','Overview'=>'Bayani gaba ɗaya','Setup'=>'Saitawa','Plans and licence'=>'Tsare-tsare da lasisi','Add-ons'=>'Ƙarin kayan aiki','Get help'=>'Samun taimako','Feedback'=>'Ra\'ayi','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana zaɓinku ba.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana yanayin saitin ba.','Match my computer'=>'Daidaita da na\'urata ta hannu','Light'=>'Haske','Dark'=>'Duhu','Colour scheme'=>'Tsarin launi','Help'=>'Taimako','Guide to this screen'=>'Jagora zuwa wannan allo','Take the tour'=>'Yi yawon shakatawa','Get help or report a bug'=>'Nemi taimako ko ka ba da rahoton matsala','Plugin screens'=>'Hotunan allo na Plugin','That could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana wannan ba.','Before you contact support'=>'Kafin ka tuntuɓi goyon baya','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'An aika da buƙatarku daga wannan rukunin yanar gizon zuwa ga %s, waɗanda suka yi wannan plugin ɗin. Muna a സമയം:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'adireshin imel dinka da sunanka, domin mu iya ba da amsa;','the subject and message you write;'=>'taken da sakon da ka rubuta;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'ID din lasisinku, don haka abokan cinikin da ke biya suke samun fifiko;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'idan ka sanya alama kawai: bayanan shafin (sigogin WordPress da PHP, jigo, plugins, wani sashi na log din kuskure tare da an cire kalmomin sirri da adiresoshin imel), wadanda za ka iya karantawa kafin turawa;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'idan kawai ka ƙara su: bayanan shiga rukunin yanar gizon ku, an adana su da ɓoye kuma an share su kwanaki 30 bayan an rufe buƙatar ku.','Privacy policy'=>'Manufar sirri','I agree, continue'=>'Na yarda, ci gaba','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Ba a iya bincika hanyar sadarwar ba.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Hakan bai yi aiki ba. Sake gwadawa.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Taimakon Zinn Digital® ya cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Tallafin Zinn Digital® ba ya sake gane wannan shafin ba.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Ka cire haɗin wannan shafin.','Connect this site to support'=>'Haɗa wannan shafin da tallafi','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'An haɗa. Mayar da martani yana zuwa ga %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Ba a haɗa ba. Har yanzu za ku iya aika da buƙata tare da adireshin imel ɗinku a ƙasa; haɗawa yana ceton ku daga buga shi a kowane lokaci.','E-mail address'=>'Adireshin imel','Your name (optional)'=>'Sunanka (ba dole ba ne)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Na yarda in haɗa wannan shafin da tallafin Zinn Digital®. Yana tura adreshin wannan shafin, nau\'ikan WordPress da PHP da nau\'ikan fakitin (plugin), kuma ana iya cire haɗin a kowane lokaci daga nan ko ta Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Haɗa','I need help'=>'Ina buƙatar taimako','Report a bug'=>'Bayar da rahoton kwaro','Send feedback'=>'Aika ra\'ayi','Request a feature'=>'Nemi wani fasali','The site details could not be read.'=>'Ba a iya karanta bayanan shafin ba.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya aika roƙonku ba. Maimaita a \'yan mintoci kaɗan.','WordPress admin'=>'Admin na WordPress','File manager'=>'Manajan fayil','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Ra\'ayoyi da buƙatun fasali','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'An tura. Abin tunawa na ku shine %s, kuma amsar mu za ta zo ta imel.','What is it about?'=>'Me ye game da shi?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Mayar da martani zuwa (imel)','Subject'=>'Batun','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Me kika yi, me kika sa ran gani, kuma me ya faru a maimakon haka?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Haɗa bayanan shafin (sigogi, jigo, kayan aiki, ragowar log ɗin kuskure)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Ga abin da aka aika daidai','Loading…'=>'Ana lodawa…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Shiga don tallafi (na zaɓi, an adana shi da boye-boye)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'Ana aika da shiga tare da kalmarr sirrinta kawai. Bar wani sahu maimakon a bar shi rabin cika.','Login address'=>'Adreshin shiga','Username'=>'Sunan mai amfani','Password'=>'Kalmar sirri','Add a login'=>'Ƙara shiga','Create a temporary support login'=>'Ƙirƙiri shigarwar goyon baya ta ɗan lokaci','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Wani mai amfani daban don ƙungiyar tallafin mu, ba tare da izinin shiga masu amfani ba, shigar da kari ko gyara lamba ba. Ana goge shi ta atomatik idan lokacinsa ya ƙare, ko duk lokacin da ka soke shi a ƙasa.','Yes, for %d day'=>'E, na kwanaki %d' . "\0" . 'Ee, na kwanaki %d','Send'=>'Aika','The list could not be loaded.'=>'Ba a iya loda jerin ba.','That login could not be removed.'=>'Ba a iya cire wannan shiga ba.','Temporary support logins'=>'Shiga tallafi na wucin gadi','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Babu. Tallafi zai iya shiga cikin wannan rukunin yanar gizon ne kawai idan kun ƙirƙiri shiga anan.','expired, being removed'=>'ya ƙare, ana cirewa','expires %s'=>'yana karewa %s','Revoke now'=>'Soke yanzu','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Mataki na %1$d na %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Rufe yawon shakatawa','Back'=>'Koma baya','Everything in one place'=>'Komai a wuri guda','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Waɗannan shafuka suna kai ka zuwa kowane allo na ƙarin hasken: saiti, saituna, lasisin ka, taimako da ƙari.','Help on every screen'=>'Taimako a kowane allo','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Buɗe wannan menu don samun jagora zuwa allo da kake kai, wannan rangadin, ko don neman taimako daga gare mu.','Light or dark'=>'Haske ko duhu','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Zaɓi haske, duhu, ko daidai da na kwamfutarka. Zaɓinka na musamman ne a gare ka kadai.','Welcome'=>'Barka da zuwa','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Wannan ɗan gajeren yawon shakatawa yana nuna inda abubuwa suke. Kuna iya barin shi a duk lokacin da kuke so tare da Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Shafinka a takaice','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'An nuna ci gaban saiti da shirin ku a nan, tare da abu na gaba da ya kamata a yi.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Shirin ku, adadin shafukan da yake ɗauka, da kuma ko wannan kwafin shafin yana ƙidaya zuwa ga wannan iyaka.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Gwada Pro ko inganta','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Fara gwaji kyauta ba tare da katin banki ba, haɓaka, ko sabuntawa, duk daga nan.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Kowane siffa da kuma tsarin da ya ƙunshi ta. Bincika wata siffa ko nuna wuri ɗaya a lokaci guda.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Ƙari daga Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Matatun da ke aiki tare da wannan, da kuma sabis daga ƙungiyar ɗaya. Katin da kuka ɓoye a wasu allo za a iya sake nuna su anan.','Connect for faster help'=>'Haɗa don saurin taimako','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Haɗewa zaɓi ne. Yana ba ku damar tura buƙatun ku ba tare da rubuta imel ɗin ku a kowane lokaci ba, kuma za ku iya cire haɗin a duk lokacin da kuka so.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Nemi taimako ko ka ba da rahoton matsala','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Bayyana abin da ya faru. Ka zaɓa ko za ka haɗa bayanai kan shafin, kuma za ka iya ganin abin da ke ciki da farko.','Temporary support access'=>'Tallafin wucin gadi na fasaha','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Idan goyon baya yana buƙatar duba cikin shafin ku, ƙirƙirar shiga ta wucin gadi a nan. Tana share kanta lokacin da ta ƙare, kuma za ku iya cire ta a kowane lokaci.','Tell us what to build'=>'Ka gaya mana abin da za mu gina','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Aiko da wani ra\'ayi, buƙatar wani fasali, ko kuma kowane irin ra\'ayi. Yana zuwa kai tsaye ga ƙungiyar.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Wannan yana ɗaukar ƴan mintuna kuma yana saita %s domin ya yi aiki a kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon nan take. Za ka iya canza komai daga baya.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Kana da shirye. Idan wani abu bai yi aiki yadda ake tsammani ba, muna da nisan dannawa ɗaya kawai.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Mataki na %1$d na %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Gama','Skip setup'=>'Tsallake saiti','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock, Shugaban Zinn Digital® Ltd ne ya gina shi','Version %s'=>'Mawadata %s','Tranzly website'=>'Shafin yanar gizo na Tranzly','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Shafin yanar gizo na Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Duba tsare-tsaren Pro da farashinsu','Languages'=>'Harsuna','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Harshe na farko shine wanda aka rubuta abubuwan da ke cikin ku. Baƙi suna canzawa tare da tubalin sauya harshe.','(default)'=>'(tsohuwa)','Locale code'=>'Lambar yanki','For example fr_FR'=>'Misali fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Sunane (ba tilas ba ne)','For example Français'=>'Misali Français','Add language'=>'Ƙara harshe','Front-end output'=>'Abubuwan da ke fita a ɓangaren masu amfani','Class name prefix'=>'Gabatarwar sunan ajin','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kowane suna na ajin da fasahar ta buga a shafukanku yana farawa da wannan maƙunsar, ta yadda shafukan ba za su bayyana wace fasaha ce ta gina su ba. Haruffa ƙanana 1 zuwa 8 ko lambobi, suna farawa da harafi.','Beta updates'=>'Sabuntawar Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Wannan shafin yana karɓar nau\'ikan beta a matsayin sabuntawa.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Wannan shafin yana karɓar ingantattun sassa kawai.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Canza wannan a shafin Asusu','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Ana ba da sigogin Beta ga shigarwar Pro masu lasisi waɗannan da ke haɗa da asusunsu. Da zarar an haɗa, zaku iya shiga daga shafin Asusun.','Save settings'=>'Ajiye saituna','First engine that is set up'=>'Injin na farko da aka saita','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'An adana maɓallin. An adana shi a boye kuma ba za a sake nuna shi ba.','Engine settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan injin.','Glossary saved.'=>'An adana ƙamus ɗin.','Your keys'=>'Makullan ku','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly na kiran ayyukan fassara ta amfani da asusun ku na kanku. Ana adana maɓallan a rufe a cikin bayanan bayananku kuma ana aika su ne kawai zuwa sabis ɗin da suke ciki. Ana saita maɓallan samfurin AI a cikin saitunan AI.','%s API key'=>'%s Makullin API','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'An adana: %s. Shigar da sabon maɓalli don maye gurbinsa, ko a adana fanko don cire shi.','No key saved.'=>'Ba a adana maɓalli ba.','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Yankin Azure (bar shi a fanko don albarkatun duniya)','Save key'=>'Adana maɓalli','Check my DeepL usage'=>'Bincika yawan amfani na da DeepL','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'An yi amfani da haruffa %1$s daga cikin %2$s a wannan lokacin na biyan kuɗi.','Which engine translates'=>'Wanne injini ne ke fassara','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'Ba a saita wani inji ba tukuna. Ajiye madogara a sama (ko a saita samfurin AI) don fara fassara.','Default engine'=>'Injin tsohuwa (tsohuwar injin)','A different engine per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Wani injiniya daban ga kowane harshe, madadin mai zuwa ta atomatik, da iyakokin kashe kuɗi na wata-wata fasaloli ne na Tranzly Pro.','Engine for %s'=>'Injin don %s','The default engine'=>'Injin tsohuwar akawa','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'Idan wani inji ya gaza ko ya kai iyaka, ka gwada waɗannan na gaba, a cikin wannan tsari','Monthly spending caps'=>'Iyaka kudaden wata-wata','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'Lokacin da injiniya ya kai ga iyakarsa, ba a aika masa da wani abu ba har sai wata mai zuwa kuma rahoton fassarar da ba ta yi nasara ba yana bayanin dalilin. Bar shi babu komai don rashin iyaka.','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s (wanda aka kashe a wannan wata: $%2$s)','Save caps'=>'Ajiye manyan haruffa','Glossary and words never translated'=>'Ƙamus da kalmomin da ba a taɓa fassara su ba','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'Kada a taba fassara wadannan kalmomi (daya a kowace layi)','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'Sunayen alama da samfurka suna nan yadda suke, tare da kowane inji.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Fassarorin da aka fi so da kuma salon magana a kowane harshe sune fasalolin Tranzly Pro.','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'Fassarar da aka fi so (daya kowace layiya: term = translation)','Formality'=>'Girma da mutunci','Default'=>'Na asali','Formal'=>'Na gida da waje','Informal'=>'Ba a tsara ba','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'Umarnin salo (marubuta, murya mai alama)','Save glossary'=>'Ajiye ƙamus','Settings'=>'Saituna','Translation engine'=>'Injin fassara','What Tranzly translates on this site'=>'Abubuwan da Tranzly ke fassarawa a wannan shafin','found, translated with your content'=>'an samo, an fassara da abubuwan da ke cikin ku','not on this site'=>'ba a kan wannan shafin ba','With Tranzly Pro: Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen and WPBakery pages; everything in WooCommerce, with prices in the visitor’s currency; the SEO fields of Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress and All in One SEO; ACF, Meta Box and Pods fields; forms and their e-mails; your theme’s and plugins’ own text; and comments and reviews.'=>'Tare da Tranzly Pro: shafukan Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen da WPBakery; komai a cikin WooCommerce, tare da farashi a cikin kudin mai ziyara; filayen SEO na Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress da All in One SEO; filayen ACF, Meta Box da Pods; fom da imel ɗinsu; rubutun jigon ku da plugins ɗinku; da sharhi da sake dubawa.','Shop text and e-mails'=>'Rubutun shago da imel','E-mail subjects and headings, payment and shipping method names, and the checkout notices. Each order’s e-mails go out in the language it was placed in.'=>'Jigon imel da kan batutuwa, sunan hanyoyin biyan kuɗi da jigilar kaya, da sanarwar biyan kuɗi. Imel din kowane oda yana fita ne da harshen da aka yi odar a ciki.','Forms and their e-mails'=>'Formuna da imel ɗinsu','Every form keeps one list of entries; its labels, buttons, messages and e-mails appear in the visitor’s language.'=>'Kowace fom tana kiyaye jerin shigarwa ɗaya; alamunta, maɓallanta, saƙonninta da imel ɗinta suna bayyana a cikin harshen baƙo.','Saved.'=>'An adana.','No ACF, Meta Box or Pods fields are defined yet.'=>'Ba a bayyana filayen ACF, Meta Box ko Pods ba tukuna.','Field'=>'Filo','Where'=>'Ina','In a translation'=>'A cikin fassara','What happens to %s in a translation'=>'Me ke faruwa ga %s a cikin fassara','Translate it'=>'Fassara shi','Copy it as it is'=>'Kwafi kamar yadda yake','Leave it empty'=>'Bar shi a bace','The shop’s currency'=>'Kudin shago','Currencies'=>'Kuɗaɗe','Show prices in other currencies (the shop’s own is %s)'=>'Nuna farashi a wasu kudin (na shagon su ne %s)','Exchange rates'=>'Farashin musayar kudi','Rates last updated %s.'=>'An sabunta ƙimar ƙarshe a %s.','Rates have not been fetched yet.'=>'Ba a samo ƙididdiga ba tukuna.','Update the rates now'=>'Sabunta ƙimar yanzu','New currency'=>'Sabon kudin kasa','Choose…'=>'Zabi...','Rate (per 1 %s)'=>'Farashi (kowane 1 %s)','Typing a rate keeps it: the daily update will not change it.'=>'Rubuta ƙimar tana kiyaye ta: sabuntawar yau da kullun ba za ta canza ta ba.','Rounding'=>'Zagewa','None'=>'Babbu','Round up'=>'Zagewa','Round to the nearest'=>'Kewaya zuwa mafi kusa','Round down'=>'Zagewa zuwa kasa','Round to (for example 1, 0.05 or 10)'=>'Zagewa zuwa (misali 1, 0.05 ko 10)','Prices end in (for example 0.99)'=>'Farashin yana ƙarewa a (misali 0.99)','Add a currency'=>'Ƙara kuɗi','Which visitors see which currency'=>'Wadanne baƙi ke ganin wacce tsabar kuɗi','By country: two-letter country code (for example CH)'=>'Ta ƙasa: lambar ƙasa mai haruffa biyu (misali CH)','Visitors from %s'=>'Masu ziyara daga %s','Let visitors choose (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])'=>'Bar wa baƙi damar zaɓar (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])','Prices now depend on a cookie or on the visitor’s country: make sure your page cache varies by the "tranzly_currency" cookie, or excludes shop pages.'=>'Farashin yanzu ya dogara ne a kan cookie ko kuma ƙasar mai ziyara: tabbatar cewa cache ɗin shafinka ya bambanta ta wurin cookie ɗin "tranzly_currency", ko kuma ya cire shafukan shago.','Save currencies'=>'Ajiye kudin waje','The words your theme and plugins print themselves (buttons, labels). Read a theme or plugin once, then translate its text here; your translation wins over the plugin’s own.'=>'Kalmomin da jigo da plugins ɗinka ke bugawa da kansu (maɓalli, lakabi). Karanta jigo ko plugin sau ɗaya, sannan ka fassara rubutunsa a nan; fassararka ta fi ta plugin ɗin kansa.','%d texts'=>'%d rubutun','not read yet'=>'ba a karanta ba tukuna','Read again'=>'Karanta kuma','Read its text'=>'Karanta rubutunsa','Translate'=>'Fassara','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'An fara aikin tare da fassara %d da za a yi. Yana gudana a bangon baya: zaka iya rufe wannan shafin.','Queued again.'=>'An sake saka shi a layin jira.','Running'=>'Yana gudana','Finished'=>'An kammala','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'Sanya injin fassara a cikin shafin Injin da farko.','Translate every'=>'Fassara kowane','Into'=>'Zuwa cikin','With'=>'Tare da','Each language’s own engine'=>'Injin kowane harshe da kansa','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Bugaci fassarorin (in ba haka ba za a adana su a matsayin zane-zane)','Estimate the cost'=>'Kiyasta farashin','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'Rubutattun posts %1$d, haruffa %2$s. Farashin wannan injin ba a san shi a gaba ba.','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'%1$d wallafe-wallafe, %2$s haruffa: kimanin $%3$s a kan asusunka.','Start translating'=>'Fara fassarwa','Jobs'=>'Ayuka','No translation jobs yet.'=>'Babu ayyukan fassara tukuna.','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'Aiki %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'%1$d na %2$d an fassara, %3$d ya gaza, %4$d an tsallake (an kiyaye ko riga a cikin wannan harshen)','Stop this job'=>'Dakatar da wannan aikin','See what failed and why'=>'Ga abin da ya gaza da dalili','Content'=>'Abubuwan ciki','Language'=>'Harshe','What went wrong'=>'Abin da ya lalace','Fix it'=>'Gyara shi','Retry with'=>'Sake gwadawa tare da','The same engine'=>'Injin ɗaya','Retry'=>'Maimaita','Translate by hand'=>'Fassara da hannu','Menus saved.'=>'An adana menus.','%d texts translated.'=>'An fassara rubututtuka %d.','Saved. Your corrections are protected from machine translation.'=>'An adana. Gyaran ku yana kariya daga fassarar na\'ura.','The same menu, translated'=>'Wannan menu ɗin, an fassara shi','A separate menu per language'=>'Wani menu na daban ga kowane harshe','By default each menu is translated: its links lead to the translated pages, with their titles. Choose a menu of its own for a language here instead.'=>'A tsohuwar hanya ana fassara kowace menu: hanyoyin sadarwarta suna kaiwa zuwa shafukan da aka fassara, tare da batutuwan su. Zaɓi menu nata don wani harshe a nan maimakon haka.','Shared text'=>'Rubutun da aka raba','Which text'=>'Wane rubutu','Menu labels'=>'Lakabobin menu','Templates, headers, footers and patterns'=>'Abubuwan da aka tsara, shugabanni, ƙafafu da tsarin rubutu','Templates, headers, footers and patterns (Pro)'=>'Samfura, shugabanni, ƙafafu da tsari (Pro)','Translate the missing text'=>'Fassara rubutun da ya ɓace','There is no text to translate here.'=>'Ba a da wani rubutu da za a fassara a nan.','Corrected by a person, protected'=>'Wani mutum ya gyara, an kiyaye shi','Save corrections'=>'Ajiye gyare-gyare','Languages and settings'=>'Harsuna da saituna','Engines'=>'Injinuna','Translation jobs'=>'Ayyukan fassara','Addresses and SEO'=>'Adiresai da SEO','Language switchers'=>'Mai canza harshe','SEO audit'=>'Binciken SEO','Menus and shared text'=>'Jerushe da rubutun da aka raba','Translation status'=>'Matsayin fassara','Integrations'=>'Haɗe-haɗe','No meta description'=>'Babu bayanin meta','A language version visitors cannot open (draft, private or password)'=>'Sigar harshen da baƙi ba za su iya buɗewa ba (daftari, mai zaman kansa ko kalmar sirri)','The address still uses the original words'=>'Adireshin yana amfani da ainihin kalmomin har yanzu','Still holds the original text'=>'Har yanzu yana riƙe da ainihin rubutun','The multilingual SEO audit is part of Tranzly Pro. It finds missing meta descriptions, broken hreflang, untranslated addresses and duplicate content, per language.'=>'Dubaing bincike na SEO mai harsuna da yawa wani bangare ne na Tranzly Pro. Yana nemo bayanan meta da suka bace, karyewar hreflang, adiresoshin da ba a fassara su ba da kuma abubuwan da aka maimaita, a kowane harshe.','Language to audit'=>'Yaren da za a bincika','Run the audit'=>'Gudanar da bincike','Check the next pages'=>'Bincika shafuffuka na gaba','%1$d pages checked, %2$d problems found.'=>'Shafuka %1$d da aka bincika, an sami matsala %2$d.','The whole language has been checked.'=>'An bincika dukan yaren.','Page'=>'Shafi','Problem'=>'Matsala','Edit'=>'Gyara','Job %1$d started: %2$d pages are being translated in the background. Follow it in Translation jobs.'=>'An fara aiki %1$d: Ana fassara shafuka %2$d a bango. Bi shi a cikin Ayyukan fassara.','%d translations are being checked in the background. Scores appear here as they arrive.'=>'Ana binciken fassarori %d a bayan fage. Ana nuna maki anan yayin da suka zo.','Missing'=>'Bace','Out of date'=>'Ba a sabunta ba','Translated'=>'An fassara','Edited by a person'=>'Wani mutum ya gyara','Machine translated'=>'An fassara da inji','Waiting for review'=>'Ana jiran dubawa','Needs a human look'=>'Yana buƙatar duban ɗan adam','Everything'=>'Komai','Up to date'=>'Ya zamani','Tranzly is still working out which older translations are out of date. The "out of date" numbers will grow while it does.'=>'Tranzly na ci gaba da gano wace tsohuwar fassara ce ta wuce lokaci. Lambobin "wuce lokaci" za su karu yayin da yake yi.','Content type'=>'Nau\'in abun ciki','All content'=>'Duk abubuwan da ke ciki','Average quality'=>'Matsakaicin inganci','%1$d translated (%2$d%%)'=>'%1$d an fassara (%2$d%%)','Show'=>'Nuna','Translate everything missing'=>'Fassara duk abin da ya ɓace','Update everything out of date'=>'Sabunta duk abin da ya wuce lokaci','Check the quality with AI'=>'Bincika inganci tare da AI','Translate the low-scoring pages again'=>'Sake fassara shafukan da ke da maki ƙanƙanta','Nothing here.'=>'Babu komai anan.','Quality'=>'Inganci','by a person'=>'na mutum','waiting for review'=>'yana jiran dubawa','Side by side'=>'Gefe da gefe','Show more'=>'Nuna ƙari','Bulk translate the whole site (Pro)'=>'Fassara gaba ɗaya shafin a jere (Pro)','With Tranzly Pro, choose content types and languages, see the estimate, and translate the whole site in one go.'=>'Tare da Tranzly Pro, zaɓi nau\'ikan abun ciki da harsuna, ga kiyasin, kuma ka fassara duka shafin a lokaci guda.','%d background jobs started, one per language. Follow them in Translation jobs.'=>'An fara ayyukan bango %d, ɗaya ga kowane harshe. Bi su a cikin ayyukan Fassara.','Content types'=>'Nau\'ikan abun ciki','What to translate'=>'Abin da za a fassara','Only what is missing'=>'Abin da kawai ya rage','Only what is out of date'=>'Abin da kawai ya tsohe','Everything (pages edited by a person stay as they are)'=>'Komai (shafukan da mutum ya gyara za su kasance yadda suke)','Estimate'=>'Kiyasta','%1$d pages, %2$s characters. This engine does not publish a price.'=>'Shafuka %1$d, haruffa %2$s. Wannan injiniya ba ta wallafa farashi ba.','%1$d pages, %2$s characters, about $%3$s.'=>'Shafuka %1$d, haruffa %2$s, kimanin $%3$s.','Find a text'=>'Nemo rubutu','%d more: type in "Find a text" to narrow the list.'=>'Sauran %d: rubuta "Nemi rubutu" domin rage tsawon lissafin.','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'Karamin maballi a kusurwar kowace shafi, a kowanne jigo, ba tare da saiti ba.','Off'=>'A kashe','Bottom corner, end side'=>'Ƙasan kusurwa, gefen ƙarshe','Bottom corner, start side'=>'Kusurwar kasa, gefen farawa','Top corner, end side'=>'Babban kusurwa, gefen ƙarshe','Top corner, start side'=>'Bayan sama, gefen farko','Switcher around the content'=>'Mai sauyawa a kewayen abun ciki','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'Ƙara maballin sauyawa zuwa kowane sakon shafi da shafi','Before the content'=>'Kafin abun ciki','After the content'=>'Bayan abun ciki','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'Sauran hanyoyin da za a ƙara maɓallin canzawa','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'Editan tubali da editan shafin: tubalin "Mai sauya harshe", tare da zane-zane biyar.','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich: abin da ke ciki shine "Language switcher".','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'Menus: Bayyanawa → Menus → Akwatin “Language switcher”.','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'Mashaya gefe: kayan aikin "Canza harshe".','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'Duk wani wuri daban, gajeriyar lambar:','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor da Bricks: widget din “Language switcher” a kowane mai ginin shafi.','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Widgets na Elementor da Bricks wani yanki ne na Tranzly Pro.','Save'=>'Ajiye','(Pro)'=>'(Pro)','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'Wani babban fayil ga kowace harshe: example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'Wani yanki na ƙaramin yanki a kowane harshe: de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'Wani yanki daban ga kowace harshe: example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'Wani mizanin tambaya: example.com/?lang=de (tsofaffin shafuka)','Category'=>'Rukuni','Tag'=>'Lakabi','Product'=>'Samfuri','Product category'=>'Rukunin samfur','Product tag'=>'Alamar samfur','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'An adana shi. Adiresoshin harshenku sun canza kamar yadda aka nuna a kasa.','Language in the address'=>'Harshe a cikin adireshin','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'Yadda baƙi da injunan bincike ke isa ga kowane harshe','Address word for %s'=>'Kalmar adireshisi don %s','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'Harshen asali ba shi da kalma a cikin adireshinsa.','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'Yanki don %s (na zaɓi)','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'Nuni da yanki zuwa wannan shafin da farko. Harshe mara yanki yana amfani da babban fayil a kan babban yanki naka.','Where each language lives now'=>'Inda kowace harshe take yanzu','Translated address words'=>'Kalmomin adireshin da aka fassara','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'Adreshoshin shafuka da wallafe-wallafe sun fito ne daga taken da aka fassara. A nan za ku fassara kalaman da aka kafa, don haka /de/kategorie/ ya maye gurbin /de/category/.','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s (yanzu "%2$s")','Search engines and visitors'=>'Injiniyoyin bincike da baƙi','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'Ba wa baƙi damar amfani da nasu harshe da ɗan ƙaramin tuta (ba za ta taɓa mayar da su wata hanya ba)','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'Boyie shafukan da ba a fassara ba daga injunan bincike (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'Ana kiyaye fassarar da ta ke dauke da ainihin rubutun daga bayyana a cikin sakamakon bincike har sai an fassara ta.','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Wani ɓangare na Tranzly Pro.','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly yana ƙara hanyoyin haɗi na hreflang (tare da x-default), harshen shafi da jagora, da kowane harshe a cikin sitemap ɗinku:','Working together with: %s.'=>'Ana aiki tare da: %s.','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'Kowace kalmar adireshisi ta ƙunshi haruffa ƙanana 2 zuwa 12, lambobi, ko alamomin ragewa.','Auto-translate on update, reviewer roles, XLIFF export for translators, switching from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress and the AI quality check come with Tranzly Pro.'=>'Fassarar ta atomatik lokacin sabuntawa, matsayin masu bitar, fitar da XLIFF ga masu fassara, sauyawa daga WPML, Polylang ko TranslatePress da kuma binciken ingancin AI suna zuwa tare da Tranzly Pro.','When an original changes'=>'Lokacin da asali ya canza','When a page is edited'=>'Lokacin da aka gyara shafi','Mark its translations out of date'=>'Yiwa fassarar ta tsofe','Translate its translations again in the background'=>'Fassar fassarorin a baya a bango','Do nothing'=>'Karka yi komai','A translation a person edited is never overwritten; it is marked out of date instead.'=>'Ba a taba share fassarar da mutum ya gyara ba; a maimakon haka, ana nuna cewa ta tsofe.','Translate new pages into every language when they are published'=>'Fassara sabbin shafuka zuwa kowace harshe yayin da aka buga su','A second AI model reads each translation beside its original, scores it and names the mistakes. It uses your own AI key from the AI settings. Start a check from Translation status.'=>'Wani samfurin AI na biyu yana karanta kowace fassara tare da asalinta, yana ba ta maki kuma yana nuna kuskuren da ke ciki. Yana amfani da naka mabuɗin AI daga saitunan AI. Fara bincike daga Matsayin fassara.','AI provider'=>'Mai samar da AI','The AI settings’ general model'=>'Tsarin samfurin gaba ɗaya na AI','Recommended'=>'Shawartawa','A page needs a human look below this score'=>'Wani shafi yana buƙatar kallon ɗan adam a ƙasan wannan maki','Publish only translations a reviewer approved'=>'Bugaci kawai fassarorin da mai nazari ya amince da su','Give people the Translator role (edits translations, never the originals, cannot publish) or the Translation reviewer role (also approves). Reviewers also find everything waiting in the Posts and Pages lists under “Pending”; publishing one there approves it.'=>'Ba wa mutane matsayin Mai fassara (yana gyara fassarori, ba ainihin rubutun ba, ba zai iya bugawa ba) ko matsayin Mai bitar fassara (yana kuma amincewa). Masu bita suna kuma nemo komai da ke jiran aiki a cikin jerin Rubuce-rubuce da Shafuka a ƙasan "Mai jiran aiki"; buga ɗaya a can yana nuna amincewa da shi.','Manage users'=>'Sarrafa masu amfani','Nothing is waiting for review.'=>'Babu wani abu da yake jiran bita.','Note for the translator (optional)'=>'Bayanan kula ga mai fassara (na zaɓi)','Read side by side'=>'Karanta gefe da gefe','Approve'=>'Amince','Ask for changes'=>'Nemi sauye-sauye','%d translations imported and protected from machine translation.'=>'An shigo da fassarori %d kuma an kare su daga fassarar na\'ura.','Export and import for translators'=>'Fitarwa da shigarwa ga masu fassara','Not translated yet'=>'Ba a fassara ba tukuna','Already translated'=>'An riga an fassara','Format'=>'Tsari','XLIFF 1.2 (translation tools)'=>'XLIFF 1.2 (kayan fassara)','CSV (spreadsheets)'=>'CSV (takardun lissafi)','Download the file'=>'Sauke fayilun','Import a translated file'=>'Shigo da fayil da aka fassara','Undone: %1$d links removed, %2$d imported pages deleted.'=>'An cire: An cire mahaɗa %1$d, an goge shafuka %2$d da aka shigo da su.','Dry run, nothing changed:'=>'Gwajin gaggawa, babu abin da ya canza:','Imported:'=>'An shigo da su:','%1$d languages added, %2$d translations linked, %3$d pages built, %4$d texts.'=>'An ƙara harsuna %1$d, an haɗa fassara %2$d, an gina shafuka %3$d, rubutattun kalmomi %4$d.','Switch the other plugin off first (its addresses and switchers would fight Tranzly). Its data stays where it is, so you can switch back; Undo removes exactly what the import added.'=>'Kashe ɗayan binciken tukuna (adiresoshinsa da masu sauya su za su yi karo da Tranzly). Bayanan sa suna nan inda suke, don haka zaka iya komawa baya; Undo yana cire ainihin abin da shigo da kayayyaki ya ƙara.','No data from this plugin on this site.'=>'Babu bayanan daga wannan plugin din a kan wannan shafin.','Languages: %s'=>'Harsuna: %s','still active: switch it off first.'=>'har yanzu yana aiki: kashe shi tukuna.','Dry run'=>'Gwajin gwaji','Import'=>'Shigo da shi','Undo the import'=>'Cire abin da aka shigo da shi','Comments and product reviews'=>'Ra\'ayoyi da bitar samfur','Each language keeps its own'=>'Kowane harshe yana riƙe da nasa','Show every language’s comments on every version'=>'Nuna ra\'ayoyin kowace harshe a kan kowane sigar','Show them all, translated into the reader’s language'=>'Nuna su duka, an fassara su zuwa harshen mai karatu','Translating uses your translation engine for every approved comment. Spam and comments waiting for moderation are never sent.'=>'Fassarar tana amfani da injin fassararka ga kowane sharhin da aka amince da shi. Ba a taɓa aika saƙonnin banza (spam) da sharhohin da ke jiran a duba su ba.','Saved. The pieces you changed are marked as checked by a person, and this translation is protected from machine translation.'=>'An adana. Abubuwan da kuka canza an yi musu alama a matsayin mutum ya duba su, kuma an kiyaye wannan fassarar daga fassarar na\'ura.','The layout of this translation was changed in the editor, so some pieces no longer pair with the original. Pieces without a partner are shown empty; edit the rest in the editor.'=>'An canza tsarin wannan fassarar a cikin edita, don haka wasu sassan sun daina tafiya daidai da ainihin rubutun. Sassan da ba su da abokin haɗa su ana nuna su a matsayin marasa komai; gyara sauran a cikin edita.','Open the editor'=>'Buɗe edita','Original (%s)'=>'Asali (%s)','Translation (%s)'=>'Fassarar (%s)','Save changes'=>'Ajiye canje-canje','Open in the editor'=>'Buɗe a cikin edita','Checked by a person'=>'Wanda mutum ya bincika','Imported'=>'An shigo da shi','Not in the translation'=>'Ba a cikin fassarar ba','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ƙara harshe na biyu a ƙarƙashin Tranzly a cikin menu na gudanarwa, kuma maballin canzawa zai bayyana a nan.','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'A kashe tun da asali: tuta kasa ce, ba harshe ba.','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'Abin da masu karanta allo ke sanarwa, alal misali “Zaɓi harshe”.','Colours'=>'Launi','Not translated'=>'Ba a fassara shi ba','Original'=>'Asalin','Published'=>'An buga','Draft'=>'Kira\'a','Checked by a person, protected'=>'Wanda mutum ya bincika, kuma kariya ce','Imported, protected'=>'An shigo da su, an kiyaye','Not translated yet (a copy)'=>'Ba a fassara shi ba tukuna (kwafi)','Save this post first, then translate it here.'=>'Ajiye wannan rubutun tukuna, sannan ka fassara shi anan.','View'=>'Dubawa','Unlock so it can be translated again'=>'Buɗe don a sake fassara shi','Protect'=>'Kiyaye','Publish the translations'=>'Bugaj fassarorin','Translate into %d language'=>'Fassara zuwa harsuna %d' . "\0" . 'Fassara zuwa harsuna %d','%s: translated.'=>'%s: an fassara.','Show this block'=>'Nuna wannan tubalin','In every language'=>'A cikin kowane harshe','Only in the languages ticked'=>'Aikin kawai a cikin harsunan da aka yi musu alama','In every language except those ticked'=>'A cikin duk harsuna sai waɗanda aka yi wa alama','Image per language'=>'Hoto kowace harshe','Show another image to readers of a language, for example a banner with words on it.'=>'Nuna wani hoton ga masu karanta wani harshe, alal misali tuta mai rubutu a kai.','Replace the %s image'=>'Maye gurbin hoton %s','Choose a %s image'=>'Zabi hoton %s','Use the original image'=>'Yi amfani da ainihin hoton','Correct this translation'=>'Gyara wannan fassarar','Saving…'=>'Ana adanawa...','Translated text. Press Enter to correct it.'=>'An fassara rubutun. Latsa Shigar domin gyara shi.','Click any outlined text to correct its translation.'=>'Danna kowane rubutu da aka zana don gyara fassararsa.','No translated text was found on this page to edit here. Use the side-by-side editor instead.'=>'Ba a sami fassarar da za a iya gyarawa a wannan shafin ba. Maimakon haka, yi amfani da mai gyara fuska-da-fuska.','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Canjin harshe','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Hadin gwiwa zuwa wannan shafin a kowane harshe na shafin. Yana nuna komai ba sai an lissafa harsuna biyu ko fiye ba.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Harshe','block keywordswitcher'=>'mai sauyawa','block keywordtranslation'=>'fassara','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'Bar wa baƙi damar karanta wannan shafi a wani harshenku daban: jeri, Allunan magani, maɓallai, menu mai sauka ko lambobin harshe, tare da tutoci na zaɓi.','block keywordmultilingual'=>'mai harsuna da yawa']];